# Exceptions for the leak guard (internal/tools/guard), which runs in CI
# as `go run ./internal/tools/guard`. One entry per line, `path:regexp`: a
# finding in the file at path whose line matches the regexp is dropped.
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored. The file itself is
# not scanned, so an entry may quote the shape it permits. Keep this
# empty; any entry must be justified in review.
